{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34769","headline":"送圆载上人 · 颜萱","name":"送圆载上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"师来一世恣经行，却泛沧波问去程。\n心静已能防渴鹿，鼙喧时爲骇长鲸。\n禅林几结金桃重，梵室重修铁瓦轻。\n料得还乡无别利，只应先见日华生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜萱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}